  "id": "visual-pursuit",
  "term": "visual pursuit",
  "definition": "Visual pursuit is a visual response whose presence in people with severe disorders of consciousness is associated with a better prognosis. In this context, it is considered an important sign of change from the vegetative or unresponsive wakefulness state toward the minimally conscious state.",
